            <span>Parking</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Set beside the Sok River and surrounded by rainforest, Khao Sok Riverside Cottages is a nature-focused resort near Khao Sok National Park offering riverside accommodation, guided activities, family-friendly experiences, and relaxed open-air living in one of Thailand’s most beautiful rainforest regions.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Guests can enjoy riverside dining, swimming and tubing in the river, a self-guided nature trail, traditional Thai massage, guided hikes, lake tours, and easy access to Khao Sok National Park while staying in spacious tropical grounds connected by elevated wooden walkways.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Our English-speaking staff are available throughout the day to assist with tours, transportation, free village shuttles, laundry service, onward travel, and local advice to help guests make the most of their stay in Khao Sok.
        </p>
        <div class="my-10 aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/uRaX30Y8TbE?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Life by the Sok River</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The river is at the heart of everyday life at Riverside Cottages. Guests can swim, paddle, relax beside the water, or float gently downstream in complimentary rubber tubes while surrounded by rainforest and forested limestone landscapes.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Next to the river is a small beach area with easy water access, shaded seating, and space to relax between activities or during the warmer hours of the day. Canoes and river tubers drift past regularly, while monkeys are often seen along the opposite riverbank.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For many guests, simply spending time beside the river becomes one of the most memorable parts of staying in Khao Sok.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Rafflesia Cafe & Riverside Dining</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The open-air restaurant and lounge area is an important part of the Riverside Cottages experience. Set directly beside the river, it is a place where guests gather throughout the day to eat, relax, plan activities, read, play games, or simply enjoy the rainforest surroundings.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Breakfast, lunch, dinner, snacks, coffee, fruit shakes, cocktails, beer, and Thai and Western dishes are served throughout the day. Many ingredients come from local producers and our small family-run farm, while fresh bread is baked at the resort.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The restaurant is also home to the resort reception area, free filtered drinking water station, book exchange, board games, free WiFi, and plenty of thoughtfully placed charging points for guests.
        </p>
