        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Families especially enjoy the relaxed atmosphere of the restaurant, where board games and other non-digital games are freely available. Combined with the riverside setting and family-friendly menu options, the restaurant naturally becomes a place where guests gather, relax, and spend time together between activities.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Riverside Massage Sala</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Set beside the river in a peaceful open-air sala, traditional Thai massage at Riverside Cottages offers a relaxing way to unwind after hiking, lake tours, or long days exploring Khao Sok National Park. Surrounded by rainforest and the gentle sounds of the Sok River, the setting itself becomes part of the experience.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Guests can choose between traditional Thai massage and relaxing oil massage while listening to the sounds of the river and surrounding jungle. The slower pace of the resort and the calm riverside atmosphere naturally make massage part of the overall experience rather than simply another activity to book.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Many guests choose to enjoy a massage in the late afternoon or evening after returning from the lake or the rainforest, making it a peaceful way to slow down and reconnect with the surroundings.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Massage sessions are approximately one hour and can be arranged through reception.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Open-Air Riverside Cottages</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The wooden cottages at Riverside Cottages are designed to feel closely connected to the surrounding rainforest environment. Set among tropical gardens and riverside forest, the cottages feature natural airflow, high ceilings, screened windows, ceiling fans, and private balconies or terraces overlooking the jungle or river surroundings.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Rather than relying on air conditioning, the cottages are designed around open-air tropical living and the natural rhythms of the rainforest. For many guests, the sounds of the river, birds, frogs, and jungle at night become an important part of the overall Khao Sok experience.
        </p>
